      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nFinal Unit Now For Sale\n\nSherry FitzGerald New Homes is delighted to present Rathgar Villas. A brand new development of only 7 large three & four bedroom houses.\n\nFeaturing striking modern elevations, these elegant three-storey family homes are thoughtfully designed to provide convenient village living at its finest. With off-street parking, bespoke internal and external joinery, and a luxurious first-floor south-facing terrace, every detail has been meticulously crafted to deliver both quality and sophistication.\n\nRathgar Villas is only a short walk from Rathgar Village, a highly sought-after location, which benefits from a host of amenities including a range of cafes, restaurants, local boutiques and shops. The nearby villages of Rathgar, Rathmines, Dartry, Rathfarnham and Milltown allow access to further amenities and entertainment. The Dodder and Bushy Park will appeal to those who enjoy the outdoors. The property is well serviced by public transport to the City Centre and the M50 is also close by.\nBER Rating A2\nRegister your interest at www.rathgarvillas.ie or contact Sherry FitzGerald New Homes at 01 6671888 for more information."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Negotiator",
        "SortOrder": 10,
        "Content": "David Rhatigan"
      }
